ment was given five percent of the  company for free huawei actually has a  dark history of corporate corruption and  bribery  in fact their former ceo lai xiaomin was  executed for bribery and corruption in  january of this year so it's quite odd  that the ccp is forcing the ant group to  work with huarong maybe they're trying  to get the ant group involved in some  sort of scandal who knows  unfortunately that's still not the end  of the story  just three weeks ago alibaba quote  unquote donated 15.5 billion dollars or  one-third of their entire cash reserves  to president xi jinping's common  prosperity fund hopefully with this  contribution and jack will finally  regain some freedom having heard how  hard jack's companies have gotten  screwed over the past year i suspect  that you're no longer surprised to hear  that his companies have lost 780 billion  valuation within 11 months but it seems  like jack always knew that it would come  down to something like this as he said  quote i think among the richest men in  china few have good endings do you guys  think jack deserved his punishment  comment that down below  also drop a like if you think jack has  been punished more than enough and of  course consider joining our discord  community to suggest future video ideas  and consider subscribing to see more  questions logically answered but until  then i'm hari and i'll see you guys on  the next one

